  "gesture": "I stop at the door, pull my heavy coat off the hook, and shrug it on while still facing the lobby.",
  "words": "Rita. Six a.m., groundhog on the radio, van's already backfiring. I need one clean word from you: is there a camera on me today, or do I grab that one o'clock coach and be out of this town before the band's even tuned up?",
  "intention": "Get a yes-or-no on the shoot so I can lock in my departure time and head to the depot."
